### **Panel with Header Template**

**IMPORTANT**: In PrimeNG v19, `<p-panel>` no longer accepts `[header]` binding. Use `ng-template` with `pTemplate="header"`:

```html
<!-- ✅ CORRECT - Use ng-template for header -->
<p-panel>
  <ng-template pTemplate="header">
    <span>{{ 'title.myPanel' | translate }}</span>
  </ng-template>
  <!-- Panel content -->
</p-panel>

<!-- ❌ WRONG - Don't use [header] attribute -->
<p-panel [header]="'title.myPanel' | translate">
  <!-- Panel content -->
</p-panel>
```

