### **Input Signal Documentation (Required)**

```typescript
/**
 * @description Button text content to display
 * @type {Signal<string | undefined>}
 * @default undefined
 * @example
 * ```html
 * <app-button text="Save Changes"></app-button>
 * ```
 * @since 1.0.0
 */
readonly text = input<string | undefined, string | null | undefined>(undefined, {
  transform: ComponentUtilsService.createOptionalStringTransform()
});
```

### **Output Signal Documentation (Required)**

```typescript
/**
 * @description Event emitted when the button is clicked
 * @type {OutputEmitterRef<MouseEvent>}
