## 🏷️ Floating Labels with Form Controls

### **PrimeNG Float Label Pattern**

**MANDATORY**: Use `p-floatlabel` with `variant="on"` for all form inputs and dropdowns in the application.

### **Float Label with Dropdowns (p-select)**

**CRITICAL**: When using `p-select` with `p-floatlabel`, **DO NOT** include a `placeholder` attribute. The floating label handles both the placeholder and label functionality.

```html
<!-- ✅ CORRECT - Dropdown with floating label (NO placeholder) -->
<p-floatlabel variant="on">
  <p-select
    id="partner"
    formControlName="partnerId"
    [options]="partners()"
    optionLabel="name"
    optionValue="id"
    [filter]="true"
    filterBy="name"
    [disabled]="isSubmitting()"
    class="w-full"
  />
  <label for="partner">{{ 'title.partner' | translate }} *</label>
</p-floatlabel>
```

