- ✅ All input signals use modern Angular 19 `input()` function with appropriate transforms
- ✅ All output signals use modern Angular 19 `output()` function
- ✅ Union types defined in interfaces file
- ✅ Complex interfaces decomposed into constituent parts
- ✅ Templates use Tailwind classes directly
- ✅ Minimal SCSS only for complex patterns
- ✅ Transform functions validate input values
- ✅ Computed signals for derived values
- ✅ File-level JSDoc at line 1 with `@fileoverview` and `@author`
- ✅ Class-level JSDoc directly above `export class` with `@class`, `@description`, `@example`, `@since`
- ✅ Input signals documented with `@description`, `@type`, `@default`, `@example`
- ✅ Output signals documented with `@description`, `@type`, `@param`, `@example`
- ✅ Public methods documented with `@description`, `@param`, `@returns`, `@example`
- ✅ Test specifications updated
- ✅ User confirmations use feedback service, NOT browser dialogs
- ✅ Error handling includes proper user feedback
- ✅ Success operations show appropriate feedback messages
- ✅ **ESLint compliance**: Run `npx eslint --fix` on all modified files
- ✅ **Translation keys**: All user-facing text uses translation keys, NO hardcoded English text
- ✅ **Multi-language support**: Translation keys added to all 4 language files:
  - ✅ UNOPS.PAO.ClientApp/public/assets/i18n/en.json    # English (Primary)
  - ✅ UNOPS.PAO.ClientApp/public/assets/i18n/fr.json    # French 
  - ✅ UNOPS.PAO.ClientApp/public/assets/i18n/es.json    # Spanish
  - ✅ UNOPS.PAO.ClientApp/public/assets/i18n/pt.json    # Portuguese

### **Transform Requirements**

- ✅ Boolean inputs use `ComponentUtilsService.createBooleanTransform(defaultValue)`
- ✅ String inputs use `ComponentUtilsService.createStringTransform(defaultValue)` or `createOptionalStringTransform()`
- ✅ Number inputs use `ComponentUtilsService.createNumberTransform()` or `createNumberWithDefaultTransform()`
- ✅ Array inputs use `ComponentUtilsService.createArrayTransform<T>()`
- ✅ Enum/Union type inputs have custom validation transforms
- ✅ All inputs with default values have transforms
- ✅ Confirmations use `feedbackService.showConfirmDialog()` with clear title and message
- ✅ Success operations show `feedbackService.showSuccessToast()` feedback
- ✅ Error conditions show `feedbackService.showErrorToast()` feedback
- ✅ Warning conditions show `feedbackService.showWarningToast()` feedback
- ✅ No usage of `alert()`, `confirm()`, or `prompt()` browser functions
- ✅ Console methods only used for debugging, not user feedback
- ✅ **HTTP errors handled globally**: No local error handlers in HTTP subscribe calls

### **Interface Requirements**

- ✅ Union types defined as `export type TypeName = 'value1' | 'value2'`
- ✅ Complex objects broken into smaller interfaces
- ✅ Interface names follow `ComponentNameConfig`, `ComponentNameType`, or `[Entity]Model` patterns
- ✅ Common interfaces exported from `shared/interfaces/` directory
- ✅ Feature-specific interfaces/models exported from appropriate feature directories:
  - Partnerships: `features/partnerships/[subfeature]/models/`
  - Opportunities: `features/opportunities/models/`
  - Admin: `features/admin/[subfeature]/models/`
  - AI: `features/ai/models/`
  - Shared features: `features/shared/models/`

