## 🚫 Common Anti-Patterns to Avoid

### **❌ DON'T Use Legacy Decorators**

```typescript
// ❌ WRONG
@Input() variant: string = 'primary';
@Output() buttonClick = new EventEmitter<MouseEvent>();

// ✅ CORRECT
readonly variant = input<ButtonVariant>('primary');
readonly buttonClick = output<MouseEvent>();
```

### **❌ DON'T Create Custom CSS Classes for Simple Properties**

```scss
// ❌ WRONG
.my-button {
  display: flex;
  background-color: var(--unops-primary);
  padding: var(--unops-spacing-md);
}

// ✅ CORRECT - Use Tailwind classes
class="flex bg-unops-primary p-unops-md"
```

### **❌ DON'T Skip Transform Functions**

```typescript
// ❌ WRONG - No validation
readonly size = input<ComponentSize>('normal');

// ✅ CORRECT - With transform validation
readonly size = input<ComponentSize, ComponentSize | null | undefined>('normal', {
  transform: ComponentUtilsService.createComponentSizeTransform('normal')
});
```

